71 0 obj<</Border[0 0 0]/Contents(GENERAL NOTES: : 1. CONTRACTOR TO INCLUDE ALL FINAL CONNECTIONS TO EQUIPMENT.  CONTRACTOR TO INCLUDE ALL FINAL CONNECTIONS TO EQUIPMENT.  2. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF FIXTURES REFER TO ARCHITECTURAL DRAWINGS. FOR EXACT LOCATION OF FIXTURES REFER TO ARCHITECTURAL DRAWINGS. 3.  20 GAUGE GALVANIZED STEEL DRIP PAN WITH 1" \(25mm\) UPTURNED EDGE, BOLTED TO 1"x1"x1/4". 20 GAUGE GALVANIZED STEEL DRIP PAN WITH 1" \(25mm\) UPTURNED EDGE, BOLTED TO 1"x1"x1/4". ANGLE IRON CROSS-BRACING  HUNG BY 3/8"  THREADED STEEL ROD C/W LOCKING WASHERS AND NUTS AT HUNG BY 3/8"  THREADED STEEL ROD C/W LOCKING WASHERS AND NUTS AT EACH CORNER, ATTACHED TO SLAB ABOVE WITH  HILTI "HDI-L" 3/8"  DROP-IN ANCHORS INSTALLED IN HILTI "HDI-L" 3/8"  DROP-IN ANCHORS INSTALLED IN MIDDLE OF LOWER FLUTES OF SLAB WITH MINIMUM HOLE DEPTH OF 40mm. 4. TEMPERATURE AND PRESSURE RELIEF DRAIN PIPING SHALL BE ONE PIPE SIZE LARGER THAN OUTLET OF TEMPERATURE AND PRESSURE RELIEF DRAIN PIPING SHALL BE ONE PIPE SIZE LARGER THAN OUTLET OF THE T&P VALVE.  5. HOT WATER TANK INSTALLATION ARE TO BE COMPLETE WITH 2" DEEP INDIRECTLY DRAINED DRIP PAN HOT WATER TANK INSTALLATION ARE TO BE COMPLETE WITH 2" DEEP INDIRECTLY DRAINED DRIP PAN TO FULLY COVER THE INSTALLATION AREA INCLUDING ISOLATION VALVES AND ALL TANK PIPING CONNECTIONS. LEAK DETECTOR AND SOLENOID SHUTOFF ASSEMBLY TO BE INSTALLED WITH LEAK DETECTOR IN DRIP PAN CONNECTED TO SOLENOID SHUTOFF ON INCOMING DOMESTIC COLD WATER. SOLENOID VALVE IS TO BE LOCATED SUCH THAT IT CUTS OFF THE WATER SUPPLY TO ALL FIXTURES/EQUIPMENT, TO FAIL CLOSED AND WITH CONNECTION TO BASE BUILDING BAS. AS PER BASE BUILDING REQUIREMENTS.)/F 64/Rect[559 365 696 786]/Subtype/Square/T(AutoCAD SHX Text)/NM(VHBYFPHXUJVYMVHA)/M(D:20241129132002-05'00')/AP<</N 1109 0 R>>/RD[0 0 0 0]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/